apacitor?", "answer": "This capacitor comes in a standard 0402 surface-mount package, making it suitable for high-density PCB designs and compact electronic circuits. The small form factor allows for flexible layout in space-constrained applications."}, {"question": "What Are the Key Specifications of the CL05A105KA5NQNC Capacitor?", "answer": "The CL05A105KA5NQNC is a multilayer ceramic capacitor (MLCC) from Samsung Electro-Mechanics with a capacitance of 1µF, rated voltage of 25V, tolerance of ±10%, X5R temperature coefficient, and a compact 0402 package. Refer to the official datasheet for detailed electrical parameters."}], "pdfUrl": "https://datasheet.lcsc.com/datasheet/pdf/02336ea48ea44ca18c72517dd3cb7b47.pdf?productCode=C52923", "authenticationList": ["ROHS3 认证"], "isRohsCert": true, "rohsCertType": "ROHS3", "rohsCertList": [{"fileCode": "wj1478399", "fileName": "MLCCCL系列_ROHS认证(英文版)_SAMSUNG(三星).pdf", "url": "https://datasheet.lcsc.com/certification/rohs/5b97a5d84519001adb216d4c9e6919ce.pdf"}, {"fileCode": "wj1864931", "fileName": " 贴片电容(MLCC)_ROHS认证_SAMSUNG(三星).zip", "url": "https://datasheet.lcsc.com/certification/rohs/fe72c154ab3703f908ae5b1ac157c1ec.zip"}, {"fileCode": "wj1624669", "fileName": "ROHS认证_贴片电容原材料_SAMSUNG(三星).zip", "url": "https://datasheet.lcsc.com/certification/rohs/329ecc8904689d9af5b272ec0ed8e00a.zip"}, {"fileCode": "wj1750838", "fileName": "全量通用_ROHS认证_SAMSUNG(三星半导体).pdf", "url": "https://datasheet.lcsc.com/certification/rohs/fe7ad62d96832adf9770d718059cff38.pdf"}], "productDescEn": "1uF ±10% 25V Ceramic Capacitor X5R 0402", "productIntroEn": "1uF ±10% 25V Ceramic Capacitor X5R 0402", "paramVOList": [{"paramCode": "param_10951_n", "paramName": "容值", "paramNameEn": "Capacitance", "paramValue": "1uF", "paramValueEn": "1uF", "paramValueEnForSearch": 1000000, "isMain": true, "sortNumber": 1, "sort": 1}, {"paramCode": "param_10927", "paramName": "温度系数", "paramNameEn": "Temperature Coefficient", "paramValue": "X5R", "paramValueEn": "X5R", "para